%%{init: {"fontSize": 14, "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "14px"}, "sequence": {"actorMargin": 24, "messageMargin": 30, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 140, "wrap": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    box PUBLIC ZONE
        participant RS as Routing Service<br>trade-imports-<br>routing-proxy
        participant JF as Journey Frontend<br>trade-imports-<br>{journey}-frontend
        participant FD as Front Door<br>trade-imports-<br>ins-frontend
    end
    box PROTECTED ZONE
        participant SS as Session Service
    end
    participant IDM as IDM

    B->>RS: POST /auth/sign-out<br>Origin, session cookie
    RS->>FD: POST /auth/sign-out<br>Origin, session cookie
    Note over FD: Origin checked,<br>sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    FD->>SS: POST /sessions/sign-out<br>Ins-Session-Token
    Note over SS: Every record John holds<br>deleted, whatever its state
    SS-->>FD: 200 end-session address,<br>ID token hint
    Note over FD: Session cookie cleared,<br>signed-out address built<br>from public base URL
    FD-->>B: 200 end-session form<br>Set-Cookie: session cookie cleared
    B->>IDM: POST IDM end-session endpoint<br>id_token_hint,<br>post_logout_redirect_uri
    alt IDM accepts the hint
        Note over IDM: IDM session ended
        IDM-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/signed-out
        B->>RS: GET /auth/signed-out
        RS->>FD: GET /auth/signed-out
        FD-->>B: 200 signed-out page
    else IDM rejects the hint
        IDM-->>B: 302 Location: Defra services list
    end
    Note over B,IDM: Later, other tab: no session cookie,<br>sign-in, credential prompt
    Note over B,JF: Later, second computer,<br>session cookie still held
    B->>RS: GET /gbn-ag/notifications/123<br>session cookie
    RS->>JF: GET /notifications/123<br>session cookie
    Note over JF: Sealed cookie value read<br>from the cookie
    JF->>SS: GET /sessions/assertion<br>Ins-Session-Token, Sec-Fetch-*,<br>Ins-Browser-Accept
    Note over SS: Sealed cookie value identifies<br>no record
    SS-->>JF: 404 session-unknown
    JF-->>B: 302 Location: /auth/sign-in<br>?redirect=/gbn-ag/notifications/123
